<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 114.74 to 7918.10.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 5.99 to 479.54.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.55.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 2026 to 804.</p>
<p>Volume was 545,580,020 compared with 514,257,600 on Monday.</p>
